son":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- v4.7.2.stable.flathub [ed1daf0bf]\n- Not tested, but code on `master` is still the same.\n\n### System information\n\nFedora 44\n\n### Issue description\n\nHot reloading maintains old instance state even if it is incompatible with then new variable type. This leads to wrongly typed values leaking into typed bytecode, which can lead to crashes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Start a game with this script from the editor:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nvar str: int = 1\n\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tprint(str)\n```\n\n- While the game is running, change the script like this:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nvar str: String = \"\"\n\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tprint(str.bigrams())\n```\n\n- Save to trigger a hot reload\n- Kaboom 💣\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[hot-reload-crash-change-type-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33280854/hot-reload-crash-change-type-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124352/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124352/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}